Secret Rooms Mod
  by AbrarSyed, wyn_price and Sindavar33
  https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/secretroomsmod
  https://github.com/Wyn-Price/SecretRooms
  Published on CurseForge under the GNU Lesser General Public License v3.0.

  The item textures in common/src/main/resources/assets/secretblocks/textures/item/
  are the Secret Rooms Mod's item textures, or are made from them:

  Its textures, mirrored left to right:
    camouflage_paste, door, ghost_block, iron_door, iron_trapdoor,
    one_way_glass, pressure_plate, secret_chest, secret_clamber,
    secret_daylight_detector, secret_dispenser, secret_goggles,
    secret_heavy_pressure_plate, secret_inverted_light_detector,
    secret_lever, secret_light_pressure_plate, secret_observer,
    secret_player_pressure_plate, secret_redstone, solid_block,
    stair_block, stone_button, torch_lever, trapdoor, wooden_button

  Its textures, unchanged:
    base_block, switch_probe

  Recoloured or edited from its textures:
    builders_goggles (from its goggles), camouflage_wand (from its switch
    probe), secret_chest_trapped (from its chest), secret_redstone_wire
    (from its redstone)

  New symbols drawn on its half-grass-block template:
    secret_comparator, secret_dropper, secret_gate, secret_piston,
    secret_repeater, secret_sculk_sensor, secret_sticky_piston

  The designs of the Secret Gate, the Torch Lever, the Secret Trapped Chest,
  the Secret Daylight Detector and the six-sided Secret Redstone Wire follow
  the Secret Rooms Mod's blocks. Their code is written for this mod.

